# Cognito AI Monorepo - Coding Standards

## Monorepo Structure

This is a **pnpm monorepo** with the following packages:

| Package | Path | Tech Stack |
|---------|------|------------|
| `@cognito/extension` | `apps/extension/` | WXT, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4 , Ai sdk v6 |
| `@cognito/docs` | `apps/docs/` | Next.js 16, Fumadocs, React 19 |
| `@cognito/webapp` | `apps/webapp/` | Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui |
| `@cognito/shared` | `packages/shared/` | TypeScript (shared types/constants) |
| `@cognito/backend-cloudflare` | `packages/backend-cloudflare/` | Cloudflare Workers, Wrangler, TypeScript |
| `@cognito/backend-vercel` | `packages/backend-vercel/` | Express.js, TypeScript, Vercel |

## Package-Specific Documentation

Each package has its own `GEMINI.md` file with detailed context:
- **Extension**: `apps/extension/GEMINI.md`
- **Webapp**: `apps/webapp/GEMINI.md`
- **Docs**: `apps/docs/GEMINI.md`
- **Shared**: `packages/shared/GEMINI.md`
- **Backend Cloudflare**: `packages/backend-cloudflare/GEMINI.md`
- **Backend Vercel**: `packages/backend-vercel/GEMINI.md`

Also see the root `GEMINI.md` for monorepo-wide context.

## General Monorepo Conventions

### Commands
```bash
# Always use pnpm (never npm or yarn)
pnpm install

# Development
pnpm dev                              # Extension dev server
pnpm dev:docs                         # Docs dev server
pnpm dev:all                          # All packages in parallel

# Building
pnpm build                            # Build all packages
pnpm build:extension                  # Build extension only

# Package-specific commands use --filter
pnpm --filter @cognito/extension dev
pnpm --filter @cognito/backend-cloudflare deploy

# Add dependencies to specific package
pnpm --filter @cognito/extension add <package-name>
```

### Imports Across Packages
- Never use relative imports across package boundaries
- Use `@cognito/shared` for shared types and constants

```typescript
// Import from shared package
import type { WriteTone, RewritePreset } from '@cognito/shared';
import { TONE_INSTRUCTIONS, PRESET_PROMPTS } from '@cognito/shared';
```

### Git Commits
Follow Conventional Commits with package scope:
- `feat(extension): description`
- `fix(backend-cloudflare): description`
- `chore: monorepo-wide changes`

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `pnpm-workspace.yaml` | Workspace definitions |
| `package.json` (root) | Monorepo scripts |
| `MONOREPO.md` | Architecture & migration guides |
| `AGENTS.md` | AI agent navigation |
| `GEMINI.md` | Gemini AI context |
| `turbo.json` | Turborepo configuration |

## Requirements

- **Node.js**: >= 18.0.0
- **pnpm**: >= 8.0.0 (currently using 9.15.0)
